WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.000
<v Sarah Chen>So you're on the Lumen homepage. What are you looking for?

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:11.500
<v Tom Baker>A floor lamp for the living room. I'll try shop by room, I can't see where the search box is.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:17.000
<v Tom Baker>Right, the Arc floor lamp. Six finishes and four shades, that's a lot of choices.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:23.500
<v Tom Baker>I'm not sure which plug I need. I'd just like it to work in the UK without thinking about it.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:29.500
<v Tom Baker>Checkout wants my phone number and says it's required. Why do they need that for a lamp?

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.500
<v Sarah Chen>Would that stop you buying?

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:36.000
<v Tom Baker>Probably not, but it annoys me.
